<title>USA: Interface acquires Camborne Fabrics.</title>
<headline>Interface acquires Camborne Fabrics.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interface Inc said Monday it acquired Camborne Fabrics Ltd and expects the acquisition to be immediately accretive to its earnings.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said Cambrone is a British-based textile manufacturer for the office and contract furnishing industry.</p>
